  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ASEAN workshop on Human Rights, Environment and Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support for the implementation of a ASEAN Workshop in Myanmar August 24-26 2014. The workshop will provide the attendants with the ability to discuss the connection between Human Rights, Environment and Climate Change. The Workshop will be implemented with Danish Institute for Human Rights and attendants include ASEAN institutions, leaders from ASEAN-countries, civil society, private sector and HR institutions</narrative>
  </description>
